  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 3. Q-functions at zero twist\n\nWith the eigenvalues known, `O q^{[2]} = 0` and `O† q = 0` are **linear** in the polynomial `q`; multiplied through by their denominators,\n\n$$\\nu_1\\nu_1^{[-2]}\\nu_1^{[-4]}\\,q^{[2]} - T_1\\,\\nu_1^{[-2]}\\nu_1^{[-4]}\\,q + T_2\\,\\nu_1^{[-4]}\\,q^{[-2]} - T_3\\,q^{[-4]} = 0,$$\n$$\\nu_3^{[2]}\\nu_3^{[4]}\\nu_3^{[6]}\\,q - T_1^{[2]}\\nu_3^{[4]}\\nu_3^{[6]}\\,q^{[2]} + T_2^{[4]}\\nu_3^{[6]}\\,q^{[4]} - T_3^{[6]}\\,q^{[6]} = 0 .$$\n\nThe polynomial kernel (degree ≤ 12) is row-reduced from the top degree, which is the staggering gauge: each solution is monic and has zero coefficient at the degrees of the lower solutions. Direct solutions are listed `q_1, q_2, q_3` and duals `q^3, q^2, q^1` in increasing degree.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 3. Direct and dual Baxter polynomials for every state. ---- *)\nClearAll[BaxRes, BaxResD, polyKernel, qsol, states, Dmax];\nDmax = 12;\nBaxRes[s_][q_][x_] := (ν1[x] ν1[x - h] ν1[x - 2 h] q[x + h] - (s[\"T1\"] /. u -> x) ν1[x - h] ν1[x - 2 h] q[x] + (s[\"T2\"] /. u -> x) ν1[x - 2 h] q[x - h] - qdet[x] q[x - 2 h]) /. prm;\nBaxResD[s_][g_][x_] := (ν3[x + h] ν3[x + 2 h] ν3[x + 3 h] g[x] - (s[\"T1\"] /. u -> x + h) ν3[x + 2 h] ν3[x + 3 h] g[x + h] + (s[\"T2\"] /. u -> x + 2 h) ν3[x + 3 h] g[x + 2 h] - qdet[x + 3 h] g[x + 3 h]) /. prm;\n(* kernel of a linear Baxter operator on polynomials of degree <= Dmax, in the staggering gauge; returns ascending coefficient lists sorted by degree *)\npolyKernel[res_] := Module[{c, x, pf, eqs, ns, rr},\n   pf = Function[y, Evaluate[Sum[c[m] y^m, {m, 0, Dmax}]]];\n   eqs = CoefficientList[Expand[res[pf][x]], x];\n   ns = NullSpace[Table[D[e, c[m]], {e, eqs}, {m, 0, Dmax}]];\n   rr = DeleteCases[RowReduce[Reverse /@ ns], {0 ..}];\n   SortBy[Table[Reverse[r] /. {a___, 0 ..} :> {a}, {r, rr}], Length]];\nqpoly[cl_List, y_] := cl . y^Range[0, Length[cl] - 1];\nstates = Table[Append[s, <|\"q\" -> polyKernel[BaxRes[s]], \"qd\" -> polyKernel[BaxResD[s]]|>], {s, hwStates}];\nqChk = And @@ Flatten@Table[{Expand[BaxRes[s][Function[y, Evaluate@qpoly[#, y]]][x]] === 0 & /@ s[\"q\"], Expand[BaxResD[s][Function[y, Evaluate@qpoly[#, y]]][x]] === 0 & /@ s[\"qd\"]}, {s, states}];\nColumn[{Grid[{{\"all q annihilated by O (resp. O†), identically in u\", qChk}}, Frame -> All],\n  Grid[Prepend[{#[\"mu\"], #[\"copy\"], Length /@ #[\"q\"] - 1, Length /@ #[\"qd\"] - 1, qpoly[#[\"q\"][[1]], u], qpoly[#[\"qd\"][[1]], u]} & /@ states, {\"mu\", \"copy\", \"deg q_i\", \"deg q^j\", \"q_1\", \"lowest dual\"}], Frame -> All]}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
