rut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">125</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3249</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3094</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.9628em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.4255em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.9628em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.4628em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7051em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.4628em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.4628em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1153em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.4628em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3204em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.4628em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5255em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.4628em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.7255em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.4628em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.9255em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.4628em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.9628em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.6078em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[42]= \\begin{matrix}\\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{all q annihilated by O (resp. O$\\dag$), identically in u} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}\\\\\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{mu} & \\text{copy} & \\text{deg q\\_i} & \\text{deg q\\^{}j} & \\text{q\\_1} & \\text{lowest dual}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\} & 1 & \\left\\{0,3,6\\right\\} & \\left\\{0,3,6\\right\\} & 1 & 1\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,3,0\\right\\} & 1 & \\left\\{1,2,6\\right\\} & \\left\\{0,4,5\\right\\} & u-\\frac{91}{57} & 1\\\\\\hline\\left\\{4,1,1\\right\\} & 1 & \\left\\{0,4,5\\right\\} & \\left\\{1,2,6\\right\\} & 1 & u-\\frac{34}{57}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,2,1\\right\\} & 1 & \\left\\{1,3,5\\right\\} & \\left\\{1,3,5\\right\\} & u-\\frac{434}{285} & u-\\frac{191}{285}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,2,1\\right\\} & 2 & \\left\\{1,3,5\\right\\} & \\left\\{1,3,5\\right\\} & u-\\frac{61}{57} & u-\\frac{64}{57}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,2,2\\right\\} & 1 & \\left\\{2,3,4\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,3,4\\right\\} & u^2-\\frac{125\\,u}{57}+\\frac{3094}{3249} & u^2-\\frac{125\\,u}{57}+\\frac{3094}{3249}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}\\end{matrix}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "9e11b101-94b6-4431-89a7-8f63d922874f"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 4. Measure, orthogonality identity, and the 3×3 matrix\n\nWith `λ = {2,1,0}` at both sites, `Γ[ν_1^{[2]}]/Γ[ν_3^{[2]}] = ∏_α Γ((u-θ_α-h)/h)/Γ((u-θ_α+h)/h) ∝ μ(u) = ∏_α 1/((u-θ_α)(u-θ_α-h))`; it satisfies `μ^{[2]}/μ = ν_1^{[2]}/ν_3^{[2]}`, which is what makes (12.41) work.\n\n`T_3` is the quantum determinant and cancels in `O^A - O^B`, and so does the identity. With `E_2 = μ/(ν_1ν_1^{[-2]})` (poles `θ_α + nh`, `n = 0..3`) and `ΔT_2 = Δt_1 u^2 + Δt_{21} u + Δt_{20}`,\n\n$$0 = L_s\\Big[E_2\\, q^j_A\\big(-\\Delta T_1\\,\\nu_1^{[-2]} q^B_i + \\Delta T_2\\, q^{B[-2]}_i\\big)\\Big] = R^{AB}_{s,i,j}\\cdot(\\Delta t_1, \\Delta t_{21}, \\Delta t_{20})^T,$$\n\n$$R^{AB}_{s,i,j} = \\Big(L_s\\big[E_2 q^j_A(-\\nu_1^{[-2]}q^B_i + u^2 q_i^{B[-2]})\\big],\\ L_s\\big[E_2 q^j_A\\, u\\, q_i^{B[-2]}\\big],\\ L_s\\big[E_2 q^j_A\\, q_i^{B[-2]}\\big]\\Big),$$\n\nwhere `L_s` = sum of residues over the ladder of site `s` (separately allowed, since an `h`-periodic insertion is constant on each ladder and `θ1-θ2 ∉ hℤ`). Three rows `(s,i,j)` stacked give `N^{AB}` with `N^{AB}·Δ = 0`, hence `det N^{AB} = 0` for distinct states; `det N^{AA}` is the norm.\n\nIndices: `i = 1,2,3` labels `q_i` by increasing degree; `j = 1,2,3` labels the dual `q^j` with `deg q^j = μ_j + 3 - j` (i.e. `j=3` is the lowest).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 4. Measure, per-ladder rows R^{AB}_{s,i,j}, and the identity O^A-adjointness check. ---- *)\n(* the measure is E2meas, not E2: E2[i,j] are the site-2 generators *)\nClearAll[mMeas, E2meas, ladder, Lsum, qA, qB, rowR, dInv, fullId];\nmMeas[x_] := 1/Product[(x - th) (x - th - h), {th, {θ1, θ2}}];\nE2meas[x_] := mMeas[x]/(ν1[x] ν1[x - h]);\nladder[s_] := ({θ1, θ2}[[s]] + Range[0, 3] h) /. prm;\nLsum[f_, s_, x_] := Total[Residue[(E2meas[x] /. prm) f, {x, #}] & /@ ladder[s]];\n(* q_i of B (by increasing degree), dual q^j of A with j labelled so that deg q^j = mu_j + 3 - j *)\nqB[B_, i_][y_] := qpoly[B[\"q\"][[i]], y];\nqA[A_, j_][y_] := qpoly[A[\"qd\"][[4 - j]], y];\nrowR[A_, B_, s_, i_, j_] := Module[{x, hh = h /. prm},\n   {Lsum[qA[A, j][x] (-(ν1[x - h] /. prm) qB[B, i][x] + x^2 qB[B, i][x - hh]), s, x], Lsum[qA[A, j][x] x qB[B, i][x - hh], s, x], Lsum[qA[A, j][x] qB[B, i][x - hh], s, x]}];\n(* the three independent differences; also confirm Delta[u^2]T2 = Delta T1 *)\ndInv[A_, B_] := With[{d1 = Expand[A[\"T1\"] - B[\"T1\"]], d2 = Expand[A[\"T2\"] - B[\"T2\"]]}, {d1, Coefficient[d2, u, 1], Coefficient[d2, u, 0]}];\nd2Chk = And @@ Flatten@Table[With[{d2 = Expand[A[\"T2\"] - B[\"T2\"]]}, Exponent[d2, u] <= 2 && Coefficient[d2, u, 2] === Expand[A[\"T1\"] - B[\"T1\"]] && FreeQ[Expand[A[\"T1\"] - B[\"T1\"]], u]], {A, states}, {B, states}];\n(* direct check of the adjointness identity, per ladder: L_s[ mu q^j_A O^A q_i^{B[2]} ] = 0 for A != B, all i, j, s *)\nfullId[A_, B_, s_, i_, j_] := Module[{x}, Total[Residue[(mMeas[x] /. prm) qA[A, j][x] BaxRes[A][qB[B, i]][x]/((ν1[x] ν1[x - h] ν1[x - 2 h]) /. prm), {x, #}] & /@ (({θ1, θ2}[[s]] + Range[0, 4] h) /. prm)]];\nidTab = Flatten[Table[If[A === B, Nothing, fullId[A, B, s, i, j] === 0], {A, states}, {B, states}, {s, 2}, {i, 3}, {j, 3}]];\nrowTab = Flatten[Table[If[A === B, Nothing, Together[rowR[A, B, s, i, j] . dInv[A, B]] === 0], {A, states}, {B, states}, {s, 2}, {i, 3}, {j, 3}]];\nGrid[{{\"ΔT1 constant, ΔT2 = ΔT1 u^2 + … (all pairs)\", d2Chk},\n  {\"L_s[μ q^j_A O^A q_i^B[2]] = 0 (A≠B, all s,i,j)\", Row[{Count[idTab, True], \" / \", Length[idTab]}]},\n  {\"R^{AB}_{s,i,j}·(Δt1, Δt21, Δt20) = 0 (A≠B, all s,i,j)\", Row[{Count[rowTab, True], \" / \", Length[rowTab]}]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"714828\" data-output-id=\"16\" data-out-n=\"56\" data-sub-idx=\"18\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"10\" data-sub-start=\"19\" data-sub-end=\"21\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[56]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"38\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.64em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ΔT1 constant, ΔT2 = ΔT1 u</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">2 + </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> (all pairs)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">L_s[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord\"> q</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">j_A O</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">A q_i</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">B[2]] = 0 (A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">B, all s,i,j)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">{AB}_{s,i,j}</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">(Δt1, Δt21, Δt20) = 0 (A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">B, all s,i,j)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">540</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> / </span></span><span class=\"mord\">540</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">540</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> / </span></span><span class=\"mord\">540</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\"