rut\" style=\"height:16.6194em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3153em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:16.6194em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5153em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:16.6194em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.7253em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:16.6194em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.9253em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:16.6194em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-14.5406em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:16.6194em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-15.7458em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:16.6194em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-19.3611em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:16.6194em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-22.1169em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:16.6194em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-24.6999em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:16.6194em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-27.4558em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:16.6194em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-30.0388em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:16.6194em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-31.2388em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:16.6194em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:14.1194em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[74]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{bracket formula = rowR at these rows, all 36 ordered pairs} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{q\\_1, q\\_2 of 8\\_1} & \\begin{matrix}u-\\frac{434}{285}\\\\u^3-\\frac{41\\,u^2}{19}+\\frac{49084}{48735}\\end{matrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{q\\^{}1, q\\^{}2 of 8\\_1} & \\begin{matrix}u^5-\\frac{305\\,u^4}{57}+\\frac{325295\\,u^2}{9747}-\\frac{151058891}{8333685}\\\\u^3-\\frac{84\\,u^2}{19}+\\frac{104791}{48735}\\end{matrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{q\\_1, q\\_2 of 8\\_2} & \\begin{matrix}u-\\frac{61}{57}\\\\u^3-\\frac{84\\,u^2}{19}+\\frac{38429}{9747}\\end{matrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{q\\^{}1, q\\^{}2 of 8\\_2} & \\begin{matrix}u^5-\\frac{434\\,u^4}{57}+\\frac{215645\\,u^2}{9747}-\\frac{26466160}{1666737}\\\\u^3-\\frac{41\\,u^2}{19}+\\frac{11696}{9747}\\end{matrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{N\\^{}\\{AA\\}, A = 8\\_1} & \\begin{pmatrix}-\\frac{190363884329}{2012094675} & -\\frac{261477474289}{5365585800} & -\\frac{94309691563}{3129925050}\\\\\\frac{35950090}{2980881} & \\frac{1192934969}{198725400} & \\frac{842635009}{231846300}\\\\\\frac{233792535232}{38229798825} & \\frac{7109655853}{2682792900} & \\frac{100304301611}{12519700200}\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{det N\\^{}\\{AA\\}} & \\frac{53291113880694676031}{410708765061000000}\\\\\\hline\\text{N\\^{}\\{AB\\}, A = 8\\_1, B = 8\\_2} … [latex truncated: 1946 chars total]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
