   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Octet pair.** `T(8_1) - T(8_2) = (0, 0, -129/19)`: the two octets differ only in the constant term of `T_2`. So for this pair the relation says the third column vanishes, `⟨q^j_{8_1}\\, q^{[-2]}_{i,\\,8_2}⟩ = 0` for `(i,j) = (1,1),(1,2),(2,1)`. That gives `det N^{AB} = 0` with `rank N^{AB} = 2`, while `det N^{AA} = 53291113880694676031/410708765061000000 ≠ 0`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 7. Full-contour rows, vacuum normalisation, and the Hilbert-space norm\n\nAs in the gl(4) case (`untwisted-norm.md` §6.8–6.10), each row is now integrated over the **complete** contour, i.e. all poles of both ladders `θ_α + nh`, `n = 0..3`, with no periodic insertion. Rows differ only in their Q-functions `(i,j)`:\n\n$$\\langle f\\rangle_{\\rm full} = \\oint_{C_1\\cup C_2}\\frac{du}{2\\pi i}\\,\\frac{f(u)}{\\prod_{\\alpha}(u-\\theta_\\alpha)(u-\\theta_\\alpha-h)(u-\\theta_\\alpha-2h)(u-\\theta_\\alpha-3h)},\\qquad \\tilde R^{AB}_{i,j} = R^{AB}_{1,i,j} + R^{AB}_{2,i,j}.$$\n\nA full-contour row is minus the residue at infinity, so it vanishes when the Q-degrees are too low. Everything is computed at **three parameter points** with different `t = (θ_1-θ_2)/h`. Each point is chosen so that `√(4h^2 + 5(θ_1-θ_2)^2)` is rational:\n\n| point | `θ_1` | `θ_2` | `h` | `t` |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| P1 | 1/3 | -8/57 | 1 | 9/19 |\n| P2 | 1/5 | 46/55 | 1 | -7/11 |\n| P3 | 1/4 | 107/76 | 2/3 | -33/19 |\n\nVacuum = `[4,2,0]`; normalised norm `N̂_A = detÑ^{AA}/detÑ^{vac,vac}` for a fixed triple of rows.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 7. States at several parameter points; full-contour rows; survey of row triples. ---- *)\nClearAll[mkStates, pts, st, rowFull, fullRows, fullZero, fullTriples, fullSurvey, fullGood, vacOf, crossRows, fullOrth, ijAll];\npts = <|\"P1\" -> {θ1 -> 1/3, θ2 -> -8/57, h -> 1}, \"P2\" -> {θ1 -> 1/5, θ2 -> 46/55, h -> 1}, \"P3\" -> {θ1 -> 1/4, θ2 -> 107/76, h -> 2/3}|>;\n(* same pipeline as cells 7 and 9 (hw restriction, joint diagonalisation, linear Baxter kernels), at an arbitrary point *)\nmkStates[pp_] := Block[{prm = pp}, Flatten[Table[Module[{Bt = hwBasis[w], r, T1r, T2r, evs, ev, p, rec},\n      r = First@Select[Subsets[Range[64], {Length[Bt[[1]]]}], Det[Bt[[#]]] =!= 0 &, 1];\n      T1r = Expand[Inverse[Bt[[r]]] . (tt[1] . Bt)[[r]] /. prm]; T2r = Expand[Inverse[Bt[[r]]] . (tt[2] . Bt)[[r]] /. prm];\n      evs = Eigenvectors[T2r /. u -> 0];\n      Table[ev = evs[[c]]; p = First@Flatten@Position[Unitize[ev], 1];\n       rec = <|\"mu\" -> w, \"copy\" -> c, \"prm\" -> pp, \"vec\" -> Bt . ev, \"T1\" -> Expand[(T1r . ev)[[p]]/ev[[p]]], \"T2\" -> Expand[(T2r . ev)[[p]]/ev[[p]]]|>;\n       Append[rec, <|\"q\" -> polyKernel[BaxRes[rec]], \"qd\" -> polyKernel[BaxResD[rec]]|>], {c, Length[evs]}]],\n     {w, {{4, 2, 0}, {3, 3, 0}, {4, 1, 1}, {3, 2, 1}, {2, 2, 2}}}], 1]];\nst = AssociationMap[mkStates[pts[#]] &, Keys[pts]];\n(* octet copies ordered by the u^0 coefficient of T2, so labels are fixed at every point *)\nst = Map[Function[lst, SortBy[lst, {First@Flatten@Position[{{4, 2, 0}, {3, 3, 0}, {4, 1, 1}, {3, 2, 1}, {2, 2, 2}}, #[\"mu\"]] &, Coefficient[#[\"T2\"], u, 0] &}]], st];\nst = Map[Function[lst, MapIndexed[Append[#1, \"n\" -> First[#2]] &, lst]], st];\nvacOf[P_] := First@Select[st[P], #[\"mu\"] == {4, 2, 0} &];\nrowFull[A_, B_, i_, j_] := Block[{prm = A[\"prm\"]}, Together[rowR[A, B, 1, i, j] + rowR[A, B, 2, i, j]]];\nijAll = Tuples[Range[3], 2];\n(* diagonal rows for every state, point, (i,j) *)\nfullRows = Association[Flatten[Table[{P, n, ij} -> rowFull[st[P][[n]], st[P][[n]], Sequence @@ ij], {P, Keys[pts]}, {n, 6}, {ij, ijAll}], 2]];\nfullZero = Table[{ij, Count[Flatten@Table[fullRows[{P, n, ij}] === {0, 0, 0}, {P, Keys[pts]}, {n, 6}], True]}, {ij, ijAll}];\nfullTriples = Subsets[ijAll, {3}];\nfullSurvey = Table[{tr, Count[Flatten@Table[Det[fullRows[{P, n, #}] & /@ tr] =!= 0, {P, Keys[pts]}, {n, 6}], True]}, {tr, fullTriples}];\nfullGood = Select[fullSurvey, #[[2]] == 18 &][[All, 1]];\n(* orthogonality with full-contour rows at P1: cross rows cached once, then every good triple *)\ncrossRows = Association[Flatten[Table[If[a === b, Nothing, {a, b, ij} -> rowFull[st[\"P1\"][[a]], st[\"P1\"][[b]], Sequence @@ ij]], {a, 6}, {b, 6}, {ij, ijAll}], 2]];\nfullOrth = Table[{tr, Count[Flatten@Table[If[a === b, Nothing, Det[crossRows[{a, b, #}] & /@ tr] === 0], {a, 6}, {b, 6}], True]}, {tr, fullGood}];\nColumn[{Grid[Prepend[fullZero, {\"(i,j)\", \"# identically zero diagonal rows (of 18 = 6 states × 3 points)\"}], Frame -> All],\n  Grid[{{\"triples with det ≠ 0 for all 18\", Row[{Length[fullGood], \" / \", Length[fullTriples]}]}, {\"distribution\", Sort@Tally[fullSurvey[[All, 2]]]},\n    {\"good triples with all 30 cross det = 0 at P1\", Count[fullOrth, {_, 30}]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"714828\" data-output-id=\"19\" data-out-n=\"91\" data-sub-idx=\"21\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"17\" data-sub-start=\"28\" data-sub-end=\"30\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[91]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"38\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:16.88em;vertical-align:-8.19em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-10.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.29em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.29em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:12em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-5.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(i,j)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">