   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 7.1 Gauge-invariant triples and the vacuum-normalised norm\n\nThe staggering gauge leaves a residual freedom: `q_2 → q_2 + a q_1`, `q_3 → q_3 + b q_1 + c q_2`, `q^1 → q^1 + d q^2 + e q^3`, `q^2 → q^2 + f q^3`. Full-contour rows with `i < j` vanish. Using that, the rows transform as\n\n`R_{11}, R_{22}, R_{33}` invariant, `R_{21} → R_{21} + a R_{11} + d R_{22}`, `R_{32} → R_{32} + c R_{22} + f R_{33}`, and `R_{31}` mixes with `R_{21}, R_{32}, R_{11}, R_{33}`.\n\nThe diagonal triple `{R_11, R_22, R_33}` is invariant but its determinant vanishes. So the only two gauge-invariant nondegenerate triples are\n\n$$\\mathcal T_a = \\{R_{11}, R_{21}, R_{22}\\},\\qquad \\mathcal T_b = \\{R_{22}, R_{32}, R_{33}\\},$$\n\nand they turn out to be exchanged by conjugation (`10 ↔ 10̄`, octet sign flip). We use `\\mathcal T_a`: `N̂_A = det \\mathcal T_a^{AA}/det \\mathcal T_a^{vac}`.\n\n### 7.2 Hilbert-space norm\n\nAs in gl(4): in the total-weight sector `μ_A`, `Ψ_R` is the joint null vector of `T_a(u) - T_a^A(u)` (all `u`-coefficients, `a = 1,2`), and `Ψ_L` the same for the transposed matrices. Both are put in pivot gauge (first nonzero component in the ordered tensor-product GT basis = 1), and `H_A = Ψ_L·Ψ_R`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 7.1-7.2 Vacuum-normalised norm for T_a, and the honest bilinear norm, at all three points. ---- *)\nClearAll[Ta, Tb, NhatF, pivotN, honest, normTab];\nTa = {{1, 1}, {2, 1}, {2, 2}}; Tb = {{2, 2}, {3, 2}, {3, 3}};\nNhatF[tr_, P_, n_] := Det[fullRows[{P, n, #}] & /@ tr]/Det[fullRows[{P, 1, #}] & /@ tr];\npivotN[v_] := v/v[[First@Flatten@Position[Unitize[v], 1]]];\nhonest[s_] := honest[s] = Block[{prm = s[\"prm\"]}, Module[{idx = Flatten@Position[wtOf, s[\"mu\"]], eqR, eqL, nR, nL, eig},\n     eig[a_, k_] := Coefficient[s[{\"T1\", \"T2\"}[[a]]], u, k];\n     eqR = Join @@ Flatten[Table[(tco[a, k] /. prm)[[idx, idx]] - eig[a, k] IdentityMatrix[Length[idx]], {a, 2}, {k, 0, 2 a}], 1];\n     eqL = Join @@ Flatten[Table[Transpose[(tco[a, k] /. prm)[[idx, idx]]] - eig[a, k] IdentityMatrix[Length[idx]], {a, 2}, {k, 0, 2 a}], 1];\n     nR = NullSpace[eqR]; nL = NullSpace[eqL];\n     <|\"dims\" -> {Length[idx], Length[nR], Length[nL]}, \"R\" -> pivotN[First[nR]], \"L\" -> pivotN[First[nL]], \"H\" -> pivotN[First[nL]] . pivotN[First[nR]],\n      \"Rhw\" -> (MatrixRank[{pivotN[First[nR]], s[\"vec\"][[idx]]}] == 1)|>]];\nnormTab = Flatten[Table[With[{s = st[P][[n]]}, {P, s[\"mu\"], s[\"copy\"], honest[s][\"dims\"], honest[s][\"Rhw\"], honest[s][\"H\"], NhatF[Ta, P, n], NhatF[Tb, P, n], honest[s][\"H\"]/NhatF[Ta, P, n]}], {P, Keys[pts]}, {n, 6}], 1];\nGrid[Prepend[normTab, {\"point\", \"mu\", \"#\", \"{sector dim, dim ker R, dim ker L}\", \"Ψ_R = hw vector\", \"H = Ψ_L·Ψ_R\", \"N̂ (T_a)\", \"N̂ (T_b)\", \"H/N̂(T_a)\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
