  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 7.3 Symbolic in `t` (non-octet states) and a bounded special-point search\n\nFor `vac, 10, 10̄, 1` the highest-weight spaces are 1-dimensional, so everything is rational in `t = (θ_1-θ_2)/h` (set `h = 1`, `θ_2 = 0`, `θ_1 = t`).\n\n**Gauge-invariant nested Q-functions.** Only the objects built from the *lowest* solutions are free of the staggering-gauge freedom and symmetric under `θ_1 ↔ θ_2`:\n\n$$q_1,\\quad q_{12}(u) = \\mathrm{monic}\\big[q_1(u)q_2(u-h) - q_1(u-h)q_2(u)\\big],\\quad q^{\\rm low},\\quad q^{\\rm low,12}(u) = \\mathrm{monic}\\big[q^{j}(u)q^{j'}(u+h) - q^{j}(u+h)q^{j'}(u)\\big]$$\n\n(`q^{low}` = the dual of degree `μ_3`, `q^{low,12}` = the Casoratian of the two lowest duals). The notebook checks this symmetry explicitly (`q_2`, `q^{12}` of the top duals fail it).\n\n**Search ansatz** (stated in full so the exclusion is precise):\n\n$$\\hat N_A\\;\\frac{\\Pi_{vac}}{\\Pi_A} = c_A\\,H_A,\\qquad \\Pi = q^{a}(x_1)\\,q^{bc}(x_2)\\,q_1(x_3)\\,q_{12}(x_4),$$\n\nwith `c_A` required independent of `t` for each of `10, 10̄, 1` (not necessarily equal). Here `a ∈ {top, mid, low}` duals, `bc ∈` the three dual Casoratians, and `x_i ∈ {θ_α + nh : α = 1,2;\\ n = -2..4}`. Both `Π_{vac}/Π_A` and its inverse were tried. The test is numerical, at 30 digits and four values of `t`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 7.3 Symbolic N-hat(t), gauge-invariant Q-functions, and the bounded search. ---- *)\nClearAll[mkStatesW, stSym, symRows, symNhat, monicP, casD, casU, qfuns, qfSym, xs, tvs, logv, tgt, dualPairs, dirPairs, searchHits, symChk, t];\nmkStatesW[pp_, ws_] := Block[{prm = pp}, Table[Module[{Bt = hwBasis[w], T1r, T2r, rec},\n     T1r = Expand[(tt[1] . Bt)[[#]]/Bt[[#]] &[First@Flatten@Position[Unitize[Flatten[Bt]], 1]] /. prm]; T2r = Expand[(tt[2] . Bt)[[#]]/Bt[[#]] &[First@Flatten@Position[Unitize[Flatten[Bt]], 1]] /. prm];\n     rec = <|\"mu\" -> w, \"copy\" -> 1, \"prm\" -> pp, \"vec\" -> Flatten[Bt], \"T1\" -> Expand[First@T1r], \"T2\" -> Expand[First@T2r]|>;\n     Append[rec, <|\"q\" -> Together[polyKernel[BaxRes[rec]]], \"qd\" -> Together[polyKernel[BaxResD[rec]]]|>]], {w, ws}]];\nstSym = mkStatesW[{θ1 -> t, θ2 -> 0, h -> 1}, {{4, 2, 0}, {3, 3, 0}, {4, 1, 1}, {2, 2, 2}}];\nsymRows = Table[Factor /@ rowFull[s, s, Sequence @@ ij], {s, stSym}, {ij, Ta}];\nsymNhat = Factor[Det /@ symRows/Det[symRows[[1]]]];\n(* nested Q-functions; d1,d2,d3 = duals q^1,q^2,q^3 (deg mu_j + 3 - j), so d3 is the lowest *)\nmonicP[p_] := Expand[p/Coefficient[p, u, Exponent[p, u]]];\ncasD[f_, g_] := monicP[Expand[f (g /. u -> u - 1) - (f /. u -> u - 1) g]];\ncasU[f_, g_] := monicP[Expand[f (g /. u -> u + 1) - (f /. u -> u + 1) g]];\nqfuns[s_] := Module[{q = qpoly[#, u] & /@ s[\"q\"], d = qpoly[#, u] & /@ Reverse[s[\"qd\"]]}, <|\"q1\" -> q[[1]], \"q2\" -> q[[2]], \"q12\" -> casD[q[[1]], q[[2]]], \"q13\" -> casD[q[[1]], q[[3]]], \"d1\" -> d[[1]], \"d2\" -> d[[2]], \"d3\" -> d[[3]], \"d12\" -> casU[d[[1]], d[[2]]], \"d23\" -> casU[d[[2]], d[[3]]], \"d13\" -> casU[d[[1]], d[[3]]]|>];\nqfSym = qfuns /@ stSym;\n(* theta1 <-> theta2 symmetry at the ladder points: f(theta2 + n)(t) = f(theta1 + n)(-t) *)\nsymChk = Table[{k, And @@ Flatten@Table[Together[(qfSym[[s, k]] /. u -> n) - ((qfSym[[s, k]] /. u -> t + n) /. t -> -t)] === 0, {s, 4}, {n, -2, 4}]}, {k, Keys[qfSym[[1]]]}];\n(* bounded search: centred log-vectors over tvs for the three non-vacuum states; a hit needs the sum to cancel the target *)\nxs = Join[Table[{\"θ1\", n, t + n}, {n, -2, 4}], Table[{\"θ2\", n, n}, {n, -2, 4}]];\ntvs = {9/19, -7/11, 2/13, 5/17};\nlogv[f_, x_] := Module[{num = Table[qfSym[[s, f]] /. u -> x[[3]] /. t -> tv, {s, {2, 3, 4}}, {tv, tvs}], den = Table[qfSym[[1, f]] /. u -> x[[3]] /. t -> tv, {tv, tvs}]},\n   If[MemberQ[Flatten[{num, den}], 0], Missing[], Flatten[(# - Mean[#]) & /@ N[Log[Abs[(#/den) & /@ num]], 30]]]];\ntgt = Flatten[(# - Mean[#]) & /@ N[Log[Abs[Table[(symNhat[[s]] /. t -> tv)/{2, 2, 8}[[s - 1]], {s, {2, 3, 4}}, {tv, tvs}]]], 30]];\ndualPairs = Flatten[Table[With[{a = logv[f1, x1], b = logv[f2, x2]}, If[MissingQ[a] || MissingQ[b], Nothing, {{f1, x1[[{1, 2}]], f2, x2[[{1, 2}]]}, a + b}]], {f1, {\"d1\", \"d2\", \"d3\"}}, {f2, {\"d12\", \"d23\", \"d13\"}}, {x1, xs}, {x2, xs}], 3];\ndirPairs = Flatten[Table[With[{a = logv[\"q1\", x1], b = logv[\"q12\", x2]}, If[MissingQ[a] || MissingQ[b], Nothing, {{\"q1\", x1[[{1, 2}]], \"q12\", x2[[{1, 2}]]}, a + b}]], {x1, xs}, {x2, xs}], 1];\nsearchHits = Module[{nf = Nearest[dirPairs[[All, 2]] -> Automatic], hits = {}},\n   Do[Do[With[{need = sg tgt - dualPairs[[a, 2]]}, Do[If[Norm[dirPairs[[b, 2]] - need] < 10^-15, AppendTo[hits, {sg, dualPairs[[a, 1]], dirPairs[[b, 1]]}]], {b, nf[need, {All, 10^-10}]}]], {sg, {1, -1}}], {a, Length[dualPairs]}]; hits];\nColumn[{\n  Grid[Prepend[Table[{stSym[[s, \"mu\"]], symNhat[[s]], {1, 2, 2, 8}[[s]], Factor[{1, 2, 2, 8}[[s]]/symNhat[[s]]]}, {s, 4}], {\"mu\", \"N̂ (T_a), symbolic in t\", \"H = Ψ_L·Ψ_R\", \"H/N̂\"}], Frame -> All],\n  Grid[{{\"N̂(t) reproduces P1 and P2\", And @@ Flatten@Table[(symNhat /. t -> pr[[1]]) === (NhatF[Ta, pr[[2]], #] & /@ {1, 2, 3, 6}), {pr, {{9/19, \"P1\"}, {-7/11, \"P2\"}}}]}}, Frame -> All],\n  Grid[Prepend[Table[{stSym[[s, \"mu\"]], Factor[qfSym[[s, \"q1\"]]], Factor[qfSym[[s, \"q12\"]]], Factor[qfSym[[s, \"d3\"]]], Factor[qfSym[[s, \"d23\"]]]}, {s, 4}], {\"mu\", \"q_1\", \"q_12\", \"q^low\", \"q^low,12\"}], Frame -> All],\n  Grid[Prepend[symChk, {\"function\", \"θ₁↔θ₂ symmetric at ladder points\"}], Frame -> All],\n  Grid[{{\"dual pairs × direct pairs tested\", Row[{Length[dualPairs], \" × \", Length[dirPairs], \" × 2 signs\"}]}, {\"hits\", Length[searchHits]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"714828\" data-output-id=\"22\" data-out-n=\"136\" data-sub-idx=\"22\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"21\" data-sub-start=\"27\" data-sub-end=\"32\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[136]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"39\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:29.8891em;vertical-align:-14.6945em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:15.1945em;\"><span style=\"top:-20.411em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.89em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.6735em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.6335em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.6335em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6.767em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.1335em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.6335em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.6967em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.01em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mu</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.4967em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.01em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen de